  m_text: "How to Play\n\nTake customer orders and fill a kebap with the requested
    ingredients (bread, onions, tomatoes, lettuce, meat). Use the Grab button\n\n\nto
    pick up items and to deliver the finished kebap to the customer. You can also
    use the joysticks to move the grabbed objects nearer or further.\n\nEach correct
    order earns \u20AC5. When the timer ends, your total money becomes your high
    score.\n\nPractice with the ingredients here!"
